              "type": "text",
              "content": "10. Aditi likes solving puzzles. She recently started attempting the ‘Easy’ level Sudoku puzzles. The time she took (in seconds) to solve these puzzles are — 410, 400, 370, 340, 360, 400, 320, 330, 310, 320, 290, 380,"
